However, this trial is often activated and completed during and immediately after your , since you can also travel to Ahto West to activate the optional  and  quests, both of which can only be completed with the mandatory mission: again, this isn't necessary, but it saves time and backtracking, and it can be better to complete those two optional quests before discovering the Star Map...

